## @file
#  Watari Boot (T16a), BENCH ONLY: the stand-in for Windows' boot manager in the bench. It is
#  copied to \EFI\BOOT\BOOTAA64.EFI or \EFI\Microsoft\Boot\bootmgfw.efi of a test disk image; it
#  prints a marker with the path it was started from and resets the system.
#
